<hr data-start="1345" data-end="1348">
<h2 data-section-id="lfqdie" data-start="1350" data-end="1373">✅ 7. Restart VS Code</h2>
<p data-start="1374" data-end="1433">After all steps:<br>
👉 Close VS Code completely<br data-start="1418" data-end="1421">
👉 Reopen it</p>
<hr data-start="1435" data-end="1438">
<h2 data-section-id="1i5f1mf" data-start="1440" data-end="1463">❗ Still not working?</h2>
<p data-start="1464" data-end="1472">Tell me:</p>
