<hr data-start="42" data-end="45">
<h2 data-section-id="1qkfdoe" data-start="47" data-end="74">✅ Install THIS extension</h2>
<p data-start="75" data-end="117">👉 <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">GitHub Copilot</span></span></p>
<ul data-start="119" data-end="229">
<li data-section-id="17jz8gp" data-start="119" data-end="142">
<p data-start="121" data-end="142">Publisher: <strong data-start="132" data-end="142">GitHub</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ds4fln" data-start="143" data-end="179">
<p data-start="145" data-end="179">Icon: black + white Copilot logo</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9buly8" data-start="180" data-end="229">
<p data-start="182" data-end="229">This is the <strong data-start="194" data-end="229">main extension (VERY IMPORTANT)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="231" data-end="234">
<h2 data-section-id="1bd8gmh" data-start="236" data-end="264">⚠️ And ALSO keep this one</h2>
<p data-start="265" data-end="307">👉 <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">GitHub Copilot Chat</span></span></p>
<ul data-start="309" data-end="399">
<li data-section-id="10ncqnm" data-start="309" data-end="344">
<p data-start="311" data-end="344">This gives you the <strong data-start="330" data-end="344">chat panel</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="h645ho" data-start="345" data-end="399">
<p data-start="347" data-end="399">But it works <strong data-start="360" data-end="397">only if main Copilot is installed</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="401" data-end="404">
<h2 data-section-id="rjukk6" data-start="406" data-end="439">🎯 Simple rule (remember this)</h2>
<ul data-start="440" data-end="497">
<li data-section-id="17ebj4l" data-start="440" data-end="465">
<p data-start="442" data-end="465">Copilot = 🔑 <strong data-start="455" data-end="465">engine</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j9h9lm" data-start="466" data-end="497">
<p data-start="468" data-end="497">Copilot Chat = 💬 <strong data-start="486" data-end="497">chat UI</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="499" data-end="542">👉 Without engine → chat will NOT show/work</p>
<hr data-start="544" data-end="547">
<h2 data-section-id="1i3hg5h" data-start="549" data-end="570">✅ After installing</h2>
<ol data-start="571" data-end="678">
<li data-section-id="96bnfg" data-start="571" data-end="600">
<p data-start="574" data-end="600">Install <strong data-start="582" data-end="600">GitHub Copilot</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4aqt2e" data-start="601" data-end="621">
<p data-start="604" data-end="621">Restart VS Code</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1u04fzm" data-start="622" data-end="644">
<p data-start="625" data-end="644">Sign in to GitHub</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d1p4ri" data-start="645" data-end="678">
<p data-start="648" data-end="678">Open chat → <strong data-start="660" data-end="678">Ctrl + Alt + I</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="680" data-end="683">
<h2 data-section-id="1wbjdya" data-start="685" data-end="705">📌 Important note</h2>
<p data-start="706" data-end="806">You also need a <strong data-start="722" data-end="756">Copilot account (free or paid)</strong> to use it <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 67px;"><a href="https://docs.github.com/copilot/getting-started-with-github-copilot/getting-started-with-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-code?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://docs.github.com/copilot/getting-started-with-github-copilot/getting-started-with-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-code?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 67px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">GitHub Docs</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
<hr data-start="808" data-end="811">
<p data-start="813" data-end="886">If you want, I can show you <strong data-start="841" data-end="883">exact screenshot of which one to click</strong> 👍</p>
