/div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="request-WEB:f7285b81-67f6-4aab-be5a-9f838f10dc3e-4" data-testid="conversation-turn-10" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="dea080c9-d895-48b8-8e4f-d72e4a4b3f90" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="116">Got it 👍 if that exact option is <strong data-start="34" data-end="65">not showing in your VS Code</strong>, then something is off. Let’s fix it step-by-step.</p>
<hr data-start="118" data-end="121">
<h2 data-section-id="1y88bs6" data-start="123" data-end="152">🔍 First, search correctly</h2>
<p data-start="153" data-end="205">In <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Visual Studio Code</span></span> Extensions:</p>
<p data-start="207" data-end="232">👉 Type <strong data-start="215" data-end="231">exactly this</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="233" data-end="255"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-lbtco6v1.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>GitHub Copilot</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="257" data-end="260">
<h2 data-section-id="19xjwt6" data-start="262" data-end="315">❗ If still NOT showing, check these common reasons</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="6u6vdz" data-start="317" data-end="362">1. ❌ You might be offline / network issue</h3>
<ul data-start="363" data-end="418">
<li data-section-id="1wce5y3" data-start="363" data-end="394">
<p data-start="365" data-end="394">Make sure internet is working</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="x2v9z0" data-start="395" data-end="418">
<p data-start="397" data-end="418">Try reopening VS Code</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="420" data-end="423">
<h3 data-section-id="1fakuuo" data-start="425" data-end="468">2. ❌ Extensions Marketplace not loading</h3>
<ul data-start="469" data-end="532">
<li data-section-id="104nndi" data-start="469" data-end="497">
<p data-start="471" data-end="497">Press <strong data-start="477" data-end="497">Ctrl + Shift + P</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jal2cb" data-start="498" data-end="532">
<p data-start="500" data-end="532">Type: <code data-start="506" data-end="532">Developer: Reload Window</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="534" data-end="537">
<h3 data-section-id="clcd2z" data-start="539" data-end="567">3. ❌ VS Code is outdated</h3>
<p data-start="568" data-end="606">Copilot may not appear in old version.</p>
<p data-start="608" data-end="626">👉 Update VS Code:</p>
<ul data-start="627" data-end="653">
<li data-section-id="14yn8l0" data-start="627" data-end="653">
<p data-start="629" data-end="653">Help → Check for Updates</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="655" data-end="658">
<h3 data-section-id="5wumjo" data-start="660" data-end="695">4. ❌ Filter issue in Extensions</h3>
<p data-start="696" data-end="707">Check this:</p>
<ul data-start="708" data-end="790">
<li data-section-id="gei4qb" data-start="708" data-end="747">
<p data-start="710" data-end="747">Remove any filter like <strong data-start="733" data-end="747">@installed</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xcdukn" data-start="748" data-end="790">
<p data-start="750" data-end="790">Make sure you are on <strong data-start="771" data-end="790">Marketplace tab</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="792" data-end="795">
<h3 data-section-id="dfo5ph" data-start="797" data-end="836">5. ❌ Try direct install (important)</h3>
<ol data-start="837" data-end="960">
<li data-section-id="c1zqg2" data-start="837" data-end="854">
<p data-start="840" data-end="854">Open browser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j09mfv" data-start="855" data-end="904">
<p data-start="858" data-end="904">Search: <strong data-start="866" data-end="902">GitHub Copilot VS Code extension</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gjpe1q" data-start="905" data-end="928">
<p data-start="908" data-end="928">Open official page</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k5t95r" data-start="929" data-end="960">
<p data-start="932" data-end="960">Click <strong data-start="938" data-end="960">Install in VS Code</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="962" data-end="965">
<h2 data-section-id="f2p3p6" data-start="967" data-end="992">🔑 What you should see</h2>
<p data-start="993" data-end="1006">You MUST see:</p>
<ul data-start="1007" data-end="1097">
<li data-section-id="28ib6j" data-start="1007" data-end="1057">
<p data-start="1009" data-end="1057"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">GitHub Copilot</span></span> (main one)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wlg39x" data-start="1058" data-end="1097">
<p data-start="1060" data-end="1097"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">GitHub Copilot Chat</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1099" data-end="1102">
<h2 data-section-id="zpoumi" data-start="1104" data-end="1130">🚨 If still not visible</h2>
<p data-start="1131" data-end="1139">Tell me:</p>
<ul data-start="1140" data-end="1198">
<li data-section-id="1o9p6vf" data-start="1140" data-end="1164">
<p data-start="1142" data-end="1164">Your VS Code version</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14hlwpg" data-start="1165" data-end="1198">
<p data-start="1167" data-end="1198">Screenshot of Extensions page</p>
